<title>UK: Timah at 17.2000 in London at 0832 GMT.</title>
<headline>Timah at 17.2000 in London at 0832 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Tambang Timah was traded at $17.2000 per GDR in London on Thursday at around 0832 GMT.</p>
<p>It recorded a low of $17.2000 and a high of $17.375.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Wednesday was $17.25.</p>
<p>One Global Depository Receipt represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
